#: website/public/blog/reverse-engineering-models/index.html:6
msgctxt "page:blog/reverse-engineering-models/index.html"
msgid "Does reverse engineering need a bigger model? | REA"
msgstr "逆向工程需要更大的模型吗？ | REA"

#: website/public/blog/reverse-engineering-models/index.html:7
msgctxt "page:blog/reverse-engineering-models/index.html"
msgid ""
"What Touhou reconstruction taught me about general models, specialist models"
" and learning to propose better hypotheses from compiler feedback."
msgstr "东方重建让我如何思考通用模型、专用模型，以及怎样从编译器反馈中学会提出更好的假设。"

