"New to this? Follow the four steps below. Already have an agent? Go straight"
" to {ph0}Connect REA{ph1}."
msgstr "第一次使用？按下面四步来。已经有编程助手？直接看{ph0}连接 REA{ph1}。"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#computer">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:216
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
