#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}3. Connect REA{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}3. 连接 REA{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#first-task">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:219
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}4. Try an investigation{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}4. 试着分析一个应用{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#native">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:220
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Other targets and providers{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}其他目标和分析工具{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:227
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "1. Prepare your computer"
msgstr "1. 准备电脑"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:228
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Use the computer where your target files are stored. A local coding agent "
"can read those files and run tools for you."
msgstr "在存放目标文件的电脑上操作。本地编程助手可以读取这些文件，并帮你运行分析工具。"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:253
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Commands go in the terminal. Prompts labeled “Your coding agent” go in the "
"agent's chat."
msgstr "命令粘贴到终端；标着“你的编程助手”的提示词粘贴到助手的聊天框。"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:309
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Download the Node.js installer{ph1} if winget is unavailable."
msgstr "如果没有 winget，可以{ph0}下载 Node.js 安装程序{ph1}。"

#. {ph0}: <em>
#. {ph1}: </em>
#. {ph2}: <code>npx</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>npx.cmd</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>npm.cmd</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:315
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"If PowerShell later says {ph0}\"running scripts is disabled on this "
"system\"{ph1} when you run {ph2}, use {ph3} instead. For npm, use {ph4}:"
msgstr ""
"如果运行 {ph2} 时 PowerShell 提示{ph0}“此系统上禁止运行脚本”{ph1}，改用 {ph3}。npm 则改用 {ph4}："

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:413
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Make a working folder for your agent"
msgstr "为编程助手建一个工作文件夹"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:414
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "In your terminal, make a folder for the exercise, then move into it:"
msgstr "在终端中为练习建一个文件夹，然后进入它："

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:433
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Keep this terminal open for the next step. If you already have a working "
"folder, open it instead."
msgstr "下一步继续使用这个终端。如果已经有工作文件夹，进入那个文件夹即可。"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:440
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "2. Choose a coding agent"
msgstr "2. 选择编程助手"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:441
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent is the AI you talk to. REA supplies the inspection tools it uses."
" Pick one client below; open its instructions if you haven't used it before."
msgstr "你对话的编程助手就是 AI。REA 为它提供所用的检查工具。从下面选一个客户端；没用过就先看它的说明。"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:447
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Codex · use your ChatGPT account"
msgstr "Codex · 使用 ChatGPT 账号"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:495
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Choose “Sign in with ChatGPT”, complete the browser sign-in, then return to "
"the terminal. When the message box appears, continue to step 3."
msgstr "选择“Sign in with ChatGPT”，在浏览器中登录后回到终端。看到消息输入框后，继续第 3 步。"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/codex/cli" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:500
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Codex installation and sign-in{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Codex 安装与登录{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:507
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Cursor, Windsurf or VS Code · use an editor"
msgstr "Cursor、Windsurf 或 VS Code · 使用编辑器"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:509
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Install the editor for your operating system and sign in."
msgstr "安装适合你操作系统的编辑器，然后登录。"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:512
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Open the rea-work folder you made in step 1."
msgstr "打开第 1 步创建的 rea-work 文件夹。"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:531
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Claude Code · use your Claude account"
msgstr "Claude Code · 使用 Claude 账号"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:532
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Install using the command for your operating system:"
msgstr "使用适合你操作系统的安装命令："

#. {ph0}: <code>claude</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:561
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Reopen your terminal, return to your working folder and run {ph0}. Follow "
"the sign-in prompts. Access uses an eligible Claude subscription or a "
"configured API account."
msgstr "重新打开终端，回到工作文件夹并运行 {ph0}，按提示登录。你需要符合条件的 Claude 订阅或已配置的 API 账号。"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/setup" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:566
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Claude Code installation and account options{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Claude Code 安装与账号选项{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:573
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Claude Desktop · use a desktop chat"
msgstr "Claude Desktop · 使用桌面聊天应用"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://claude.ai/download">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#. {ph2}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/blob/main/docs/client-
#. configuration.md#claude-desktop" >
#. {ph3}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:597
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Download Claude Desktop{ph1} · {ph2}Claude Desktop connection "
"details{ph3}"
msgstr "{ph0}下载 Claude Desktop{ph1} · {ph2}Claude Desktop 连接详情{ph3}"

#. {ph0}: <code>opencode</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>/connect</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:622
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Run {ph0} in your working folder. Use {ph1} in its chat to connect your "
"model account, then select a model."
msgstr "在工作文件夹里运行 {ph0}。在聊天框中使用 {ph1} 连接模型账号，再选择模型。"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://opencode.ai/docs/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:627
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}OpenCode installation and model setup{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}OpenCode 安装与模型配置{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:634
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "All supported clients and setup IDs"
msgstr "全部支持的客户端与 setup ID"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:643
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Client"
msgstr "客户端"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:644
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Setup ID"
msgstr "Setup ID"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/blob/main/docs/client-
#. configuration.md" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <a
